es accuracy and stability while continuously holding down the trigger."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Tap the Trigger","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a7840da2970b4137a333fb187477dfe0.png","desc":"Grants a short period of increased stability and accuracy on initial trigger pull."},{"name":"Disruption Break","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/45b57ce27fa0213218c7cb8f2253c517.png","desc":"Breaking an enemy's shield with this weapon makes them more vulnerable to Kinetic damage for a brief period."},{"name":"Surrounded","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/979881b68ca7839267c9aef5aea2b0ce.png","desc":"This weapon gains bonus damage when three or more enemies are in close proximity."},{"name":"Vorpal Weapon","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/bc5130b227ee577f2678ec2d2c97bf4a.png","desc":"Increased damage against bosses, vehicles, and Guardians with their Super active."},{"name":"Demolitionist","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/da009697110e06b65d6f827b3b6d5f70.png","desc":"Kills with this weapon generate grenade energy. Activating your grenade ability reloads this weapon from reserves."}]}],"notes":["Speedrunner's Shopping List: General primary (good for: all S21 raids and dungeons)","[YeezyGT's S16] [MW: Reload] \"The IKELOS_SMG is probably the best PvE Legendary Primary we've ever had post-Recluse, and I doubt we'll ever get anything better. Threat Detector/Surrounded is just certifiably insane; on an SMG as accurate as this, that makes Warmind Cells, that can be paired with some of the strongest Kinetic weapons in the game... It's nigh-on perfect. I actually recommend Alloy Mag here for the first time ever, simply because its noticeable when Threat Detector's no longer active, and you reach the bottom of the mag fast enough to feel that 33% reduced reload speed from Alloy.\" tags:god-pve","File auto generated from csv pandapaxxy-s15-roundup (tags: controller,god-pve)","File auto generated from csv pandapaxxy-s15-roundup (tags: c